{"parent":"article.testament.json","context":{"market":"france"},"sections":{"rich_text_RLhKK":{"type":"rich-text","disabled":false,"settings":{"subheading":"","title":"","content":"<p>Here, at <strong>William Wood<\/strong>, our products are meticulously designed to reinvent your living space and unlock the full potential of your home. Today, we share how our designs can transform your space from <strong>ordinary<\/strong> to <strong>extraordinary<\/strong>. Discover our unique, statement pieces embraced by our growing community, explore the impact they make, and see how our ambassadors incorporate them into their homes. <\/p>","button_text":"","button_link":"","background_type":"full_width","text_width":"medium","text_position":"center","text_alignment":"center","header-7601c597fd338fb497e97be6c033256f":null,"background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"},"blocks":{},"block_order":[]},"image_with_text_3gMYx":{"type":"image-with-text","disabled":false,"settings":{"reveal_on_scroll":true,"background_type":"full_width","background_overlap":"image","image_position":"left","text_alignment":"center","cycle_speed":8,"accent_background":"#efefef","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"},"blocks":{"item_rgemw":{"type":"item","disabled":false,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/LiliaNaturalWEBUGC.jpg","tab_label":"Item","subheading":"Building an Identity","title":"","content":"<p>We believe our home is an extension of our own identity. <strong>Sarah<\/strong>, founder of <strong>@homedesign.meadowview <\/strong>and a William Wood Ambassador, over the years has renovated her home studio which cultivates a minimal and earthy interior. Sarah's home embraces a minimalist aesthetic, with depth, texture, and flowing curves infusing the space with her unique personality and story.<\/p>","button_text":"SHOP LILIA","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/lilia-natural-organic-full-length-wooden-arched-mirror-67-x-32-170cm-x-80cm"}}},"block_order":["item_rgemw"]},"image_with_text_rkd4n":{"type":"image-with-text","disabled":false,"custom_css":[],"settings":{"reveal_on_scroll":true,"background_type":"full_width","background_overlap":"image","image_position":"right","text_alignment":"center","cycle_speed":8,"accent_background":"#efefef","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"},"blocks":{"item_RWfBK":{"type":"item","disabled":false,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Theo_black_200_x_120_homedesign.meadowview.jpg","tab_label":"","subheading":"","title":"","content":"<p><strong>Sarah<\/strong> has selectively chosen distinct William Wood pieces over time which perfectly pair together to complement her home features. See how the curved elegance of our <strong>Lilia<\/strong> and <strong>Theo<\/strong> mirrors accompany her Balearic style, thus embracing the interior’s serenity and beauty. Collectively, Sarah has used <strong>William Wood furniture<\/strong> to transform and build a connection throughout her modern living space. <\/p>","button_text":"Shop Theo","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/theo-full-length-black-contemporary-metal-mirror-80-x-48-200cm-x-120cm"}}},"block_order":["item_RWfBK"]},"image_with_text_akTGX":{"type":"image-with-text","disabled":false,"settings":{"reveal_on_scroll":true,"background_type":"boxed","background_overlap":"image","image_position":"left","text_alignment":"center","cycle_speed":8,"accent_background":"#efefef","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"},"blocks":{"item_pMCA6":{"type":"item","disabled":false,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Leonardo_concrete_Large_Coffee_Table.jpg","tab_label":"","subheading":"The Power of a Statement Piece","title":"","content":"<p>Take a look at <strong>@homebylauren<\/strong>, a William Wood Brand Ambassador's home. While her style has evolved with our brand over time, she uses select William Wood pieces to make a true statement through both shape and positioning. The placement of our <strong>Leonardo Coffee Table<\/strong> in her living room boasts an organic structure, encompassing the natural textures and neutral tones within the space. <\/p>","button_text":"Shop Leonardo","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/leonardo"}}},"block_order":["item_pMCA6"]},"image_with_text_MEHFi":{"type":"image-with-text","disabled":false,"settings":{"reveal_on_scroll":true,"background_type":"full_width","background_overlap":"image","image_position":"right","text_alignment":"center","cycle_speed":8,"accent_background":"#efefef","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"},"blocks":{"item_fTQtk":{"type":"item","disabled":false,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Angelo_Concrete_60cm_karo.couture.jpg","tab_label":"Item","subheading":"","title":"","content":"<p>Meanwhile, <strong>Karolina Grzyb<\/strong>, founder of <strong>@karo.couture<\/strong>, places our Edge Frameless Arched Mirror to define and elevate the entire room. Adding lighting and minimal accent features, she transforms this piece into the focal point, creating a true statement.<\/p>","button_text":"Shop Edge Arch","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/edge-frameless-contemporary-arched-full-length-mirror-71-x-44-179cm-x-100cm"}}},"block_order":["item_fTQtk"]},"image_with_text_aRMcz":{"type":"image-with-text","disabled":false,"settings":{"reveal_on_scroll":true,"background_type":"full_width","background_overlap":"image","image_position":"left","text_alignment":"center","cycle_speed":8,"accent_background":"#efefef","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"},"blocks":{"item_yAj8y":{"type":"item","disabled":false,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Edge_pond_71_x_40_and_Port